00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:30.540
I didn't tell her...yeah, that would be a mistake because I didn't...she didn't tell me that–

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.460
'Why aren't you there anymore?'

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:36.100
C: Ah, I wasn't getting paid enough. It was really nice being around books though

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:36.700
C: I really miss it.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.960
