00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.000
F: Hmm...yea. I guess you're right.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.400
C: Hey, who am I to judge? I went from one sitting job to another.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.400
Still just shuffling around papers.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.440
M: Hm.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:04.360
