00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.580
F: Sounds fun! I love cats.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.580
C: Haha yea. Everyone loves cats nowadays.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.180
M: I'm more of a dog guy.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.700
F: True. Very very true.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.060
C: How much longer 'till we get there?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:25.100
F: Not too far. Haven't you been there before? I thought you get Tyler's coffee?

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:29.240
C: I usually just grab Tyler's fancy frappalappucinnos in my car on the way to work.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.160
F: Oh okay. Yea we're almost there.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.000
You know those things are horrible for you.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.740
C: I get sick just looking at them.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.640
F: Haha same!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.140
Pretty sure they're delicious though.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.420
C: Oh, absolutely.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:39.980
F: We're hypocrites, aren't we?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.340
C: Who isn't, this day and age?

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.400
M: *chuckles* Oh, we have so much in common.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.400
'Let's not get political.'

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.040
'No one.'

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:50.280
'Cats.' Cats are not hypocrites they do exactly what they say.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:54.800
F: Cats, hence why the Internet loves them so much. They're the perfect antithesis of the modern adult.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.900
Straightforward about their needs. Compact. Low maintenance...

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.580
