00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.040
Sure.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.040
F: Never thought of it that way. Maybe you're right.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:14.320
C: Trust me I live with one. I'm basically an authority on the subject.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:15.840
F: Maybe you should write a book about it.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.060
C: Haha New York Times Bestselling author, here I come!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:22.200
F: Not sure how you'd make a romance novel out of that though. Haha.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:26.060
C: Psh, it wouldn't be a romance novel. It would be a philosophy book.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.700
"The Zen of Maintaining A Tiny Self-Obsessed Person".

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.040
M: Hey, I like philosophy apparently!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.960
F: Wow, Sounds pretty deep. I like it.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.700
Ah, here we are. Time to get Tyler's...Unicorn Frappalappacino.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.740
C: Did you hear about how that was like a big deal?

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:43.460
