00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.440
M: YEAH a lot of things about this job is unsettling.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:50.380
But hey, not you babeh.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.780
F: Alright, now to get the coffee.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.680
C: Go for it. I'm going to check out the books.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:54.360
M: Alright.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:55.400
See ya.

